-- =====================================================================
-- Phase B2: Manufacturing, Warehouse Transfers & Inventory Ledger RPCs
-- =====================================================================
-- Internal FIFO helpers + production/transfer RPCs + rewritten
-- process_purchase / process_sale / process_refund / adjust_stock /
